to your greatness."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s046-u007","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s046-d007","speaker_label":"பரந்தாமன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":53}]},"translation":{"english_text":"I'll finish it. I'll finish it today itself."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s046-u008","kind":"stage-direction","status":"verified","source":{"page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":61,"printed_page":53}]},"translation":{"english_text":"(He opens the table drawer and takes out a revolver.)"}}]}